atar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T06:32:26-07:00","id":852929,"title":"","content":"As I actually teach data mining at Texas A&amp;M in Commerce, I can state that done properly, it avoids confirmation bias. It is, in fact, not about finding specific sources, but rather about using various techniques to take mountains of raw data and produce simple rules and conclusions and usable guideposts for decision-making out of them. Data mining is how, for example, Wal*Mart discovered that putting diapers next to beer caused both to sell more.<br /> <br /> All it is is transforming data into information. Where &quot;information&quot; means &quot;usable nuggets of knowledge which can help improve understanding.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm certain you can corrupt any of the techniques to &quot;prove&quot; something, if you wanted to, but it's usual purpose is to aid in decision-making based on finding causes and effects. (Which, again, could be used by the corrupt to try to guide decisions they want made, regardless of whether the actions really lead where the decision-makers want to go, but that's true of any technique for determining how to make decisions: if you have an evil vizier, he's probably guiding you malevolently.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/827-segev","name":"Segev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1001"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T08:24:16-07:00","id":852979,"title":"","content":"Oh any idea how a human will interprut Soveregn when its used on them.<br /> <br /> Esp either Dictum or Geas/Ban<br /> <br /> Dictum I hope gets clarification.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}